1
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:05,580
快看 老妈
Hey, mom...

2
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,860
听听老爸给外公的生日卡片上写了什么
Listen to this card dad got for grandpa Jay.

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:10,080
"嘿 嘿 嘿 万岁"
"Hip-hip-hip-hooray!"

4
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:11,690
多送你一个屁股
"Save the extra hip.

5
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,511
哪天你要装人工肛门时用得着呢
You'll need it someday."

6
00:00:13,511 --> 00:00:15,021
因为他是老人
'Cause he's old!

7
00:00:16,221 --> 00:00:17,671
不准你们送这卡片
You're not giving him that.

8
00:00:17,711 --> 00:00:20,321
-等他酒过三巡再给就行了吧 -还是不行
- If he drinks his other gift first? -Nope.

9
00:00:20,321 --> 00:00:21,121
女孩们
Ladies...

10
00:00:21,161 --> 00:00:23,591
还记得一年前的今天
Do you remember exactly one year ago today

11
00:00:23,591 --> 00:00:25,462
外公得知你们没有给他准备礼物时
when you did not have a gift for your grandfather

12
00:00:25,462 --> 00:00:26,752
他伤心欲绝的样子吗
and it killed him just a little?

13
00:00:26,782 --> 00:00:28,452
我建议你们赶紧去找大伙
So I suggested you start interviewing

14
00:00:28,482 --> 00:00:30,702
录些祝福小短片吧
all the members of the family for a video tribute?

15
00:00:30,732 --> 00:00:34,092
早做好了 管家婆
Well, check it and burn -- we totally did that.

16
00:00:34,092 --> 00:00:35,412
是快做好了
Almost.

17
00:00:35,442 --> 00:00:37,452
只需再稍加剪辑即可
We just need to finish the editing.

18
00:00:37,452 --> 00:00:38,263
你还好意思说呢
And you should talk.

19
00:00:38,263 --> 00:00:40,143
你自己都还没准备礼物
You haven't even started on your gift yet.

20
00:00:40,973 --> 00:00:42,643
因为我改变心意了
That's because I changed mine.

21
00:00:42,643 --> 00:00:44,723
我昨天想到一个更好的主意
I thought of a better idea yesterday.

22
00:00:44,753 --> 00:00:47,053
那主意是我想到的吧
I think I came up with a better idea.

23
00:00:47,093 --> 00:00:49,393
别闹了 我爸爸有一张
Okay. My dad has a picture

24
00:00:49,393 --> 00:00:50,864
我和米奇尔小时候
of me and Mitchell when we were kids,

25
00:00:50,894 --> 00:00:52,844
站在我们老家院子里的照片
standing in our old backyard.

26
00:00:52,844 --> 00:00:53,894
我们准备重现当时的场景
We're gonna re-create the picture.

27
00:00:53,934 --> 00:00:56,104
我去年圣诞节的时候也为我父母做了这事
I did the same thing last year for my parents for Christmas,

28
00:00:56,134 --> 00:00:58,294
反响很强烈 效果很成功
and it went over like gangbusters.

29
00:01:01,044 --> 00:01:02,274
-的确很有趣 -你还记得吗
- Mm. Funny. - Do you remember?

30
00:01:02,294 --> 00:01:03,975
当然记得
Oh, I do. I do.

31
00:01:04,755 --> 00:01:05,905
死也忘不了
I do.

32
00:01:05,915 --> 00:01:07,695
快点 女孩们 关掉电视
Come on, girls, TV off.

33
00:01:07,695 --> 00:01:09,335
今天是你们外公的生日
It's your grandfather's birthday.

34
00:01:09,365 --> 00:01:11,915
我们必须严正以待
We got to start taking this seriously.

35
00:01:11,955 --> 00:01:14,275
请尊许我上船
Permission to come aboard.

36
00:01:26,546 --> 00:01:28,347
我最难忘的生日回忆...
My best birthday memory--

37
00:01:28,347 --> 00:01:30,537
那年我还年少 在我生日那天
I'm a teenager, and for some reason,

38
00:01:30,537 --> 00:01:31,977
我无来由地就自己驾船游湖
I drag this boat out on the lake.

39
00:01:32,597 --> 00:01:35,737
在湖中休息 钓鱼
and for hours, I'm just lying there, fishing,

40
00:01:35,767 --> 00:01:37,567
独自静心思考
alone with my thoughts.

41
00:01:37,607 --> 00:01:38,707
无与伦比的美妙啊
Fantastic.

42
00:01:38,737 --> 00:01:41,278
今年我也只想要这样
That's all I want this year.

43
00:01:41,308 --> 00:01:43,078
你真的想就如此度过这特别的日子吗
So that's really going to be your day?

44
00:01:43,108 --> 00:01:44,078
就这么去钓鱼
You're going fishing?

45
00:01:44,108 --> 00:01:45,778
还够时间去吃吃美食呢
With time out for a gourmet lunch.

46
00:01:45,808 --> 00:01:48,168
香肠俱乐部的五月月度香肠超正点啊
Sausage of the month club really nailed it in may.

47
00:01:48,198 --> 00:01:49,368
亲爱的 你别生气啊
But, honey, no offense.

48
00:01:49,448 --> 00:01:50,388
上个月的西班牙香肠
They almost lost me last month

49
00:01:50,388 --> 00:01:51,618
差点害我再也不想回去了
with that chorizo.

50
00:01:52,418 --> 00:01:53,589
干嘛叫我别生气
Why "no offense"?

51
00:01:53,619 --> 00:01:56,509
只是香肠而已 又没有印在我们国旗上
It's a sausage. It's not on our flag.

52
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:01,429
莉莉 你在这干吗
Lily, what are you doing here?

53
00:02:01,459 --> 00:02:02,799
惊喜哦
Surprise!

54
00:02:02,829 --> 00:02:04,429
我们要去拿给杰订的蛋糕
We were just on our way to get Jay's cake

55
00:02:04,469 --> 00:02:05,500
就顺路过来拜访一下
and thought we'd pop by.

56
00:02:05,530 --> 00:02:07,900
莉莉今早快把我逼疯了
Lily was driving me crazy all morning.

57
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:09,630
我得摆脱她这烫手山芋
I had to get rid of her.

58
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:12,010
她不想穿衣服
She refuses to get dressed.

59
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,560
试过拿东西"贿赂"她了吗
Well, did you try bribing her?

60
00:02:13,610 --> 00:02:14,430
没有...
Oh, no.

61
00:02:14,430 --> 00:02:15,670
才怪呢 早试了
Of -- of course I did!

62
00:02:15,670 --> 00:02:17,200
我不想去哄她了 米奇尔
I cannot go back in there, Mitchell.

63
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,531
当初我们怎么会决定要小孩的啊
Why did we ever decide to have a kid?!

64
00:02:18,561 --> 00:02:20,321
我不知道
I don't know.

65
00:02:20,351 --> 00:02:21,481
我真的不知道
I don't know!

66
00:02:21,521 --> 00:02:22,621
别哭了
Oh, come on!

67
00:02:22,651 --> 00:02:23,901
她太爱你了
She loves you so much.

68
00:02:23,951 --> 00:02:26,691
今天早上 她就盯着你的照片
Just this morning, she was looking at a picture of you,

69
00:02:26,711 --> 00:02:28,571
我发誓 她当时在试着叫你的名字呢
and I swear she was trying to say your name.

70
00:02:28,621 --> 00:02:29,661
真的吗
Really?

71
00:02:31,212 --> 00:02:33,782
我也很想多陪陪她
Ay, I would love to spend more time with her,

72
00:02:33,782 --> 00:02:37,202
可我得去商场给杰买生日礼物
bt I have to go to the mall to get Jay's gift for his birthday.

73
00:02:37,222 --> 00:02:39,472
抱歉 小甜心 歌洛莉亚很忙 没空
Oh, I'm sorry, sweetie. Gloria's busy.

74
00:02:39,502 --> 00:02:40,472
别哭了
No, don't cry.

75
00:02:40,502 --> 00:02:42,472
我们还是走吧
We should go.

76
00:02:42,502 --> 00:02:44,013
好吧 其实我也可以带着她...
Oh, maybe I can take her wi--

77
00:02:44,043 --> 00:02:45,563
好的 东西都打包好了 玩的开心点
Okay. Bag's packed. Have fun.

78
00:02:45,593 --> 00:02:46,763
再见了 小甜心
Bye, sweetie.

79
00:02:46,813 --> 00:02:48,563
-你好啊 小卡 -你好啊 曼尼
- Hey, Cam. - Oh, hey, Manny.

80
00:02:48,593 --> 00:02:50,013
妈妈 杰还在吗
Mom, is Jay still here?

81
00:02:50,053 --> 00:02:52,433
-不在 他刚走 -糟糕
- No, he just left. - Shoot.

82
00:02:52,483 --> 00:02:53,483
怎么了 老兄
Why? What's up, pal?

83
00:02:53,523 --> 00:02:55,233
我要去我一个朋友家玩
I'm going over to a friend's house

84
00:02:55,273 --> 00:02:57,054
我可能得知道怎么用这手套
Where I may have to use this thing.

85
00:02:57,074 --> 00:02:58,194
我只用过一次
I only used it once,

86
00:02:58,224 --> 00:02:59,994
而且还是用来拿烤箱里的蛋糕
and that was to take a torte out of the oven.

87
00:03:00,024 --> 00:03:03,614
首先呢 我们得把手套弄软弄松
Okay, well, first, let's loosen this thing up.

88
00:03:05,394 --> 00:03:07,404
-她叫什么名字呢 -你怎么知道是女的
- So what's her name? - How'd you know?

89
00:03:07,414 --> 00:03:09,045
男生打肿脸充胖子
Well, you're pretending to be something you're not.

90
00:03:09,045 --> 00:03:12,575
通常都是为了讨梦中情人欢心 或者梦中情郎
Boys do that for girls... or really dreamy boys.

91
00:03:12,585 --> 00:03:15,305
她叫塔拉 我们在网上聊得很欢
Her name's Tara. We have great chats online.

92
00:03:15,345 --> 00:03:17,275
她德艺双馨 聪明伶俐
She's really smart and funny,

93
00:03:17,315 --> 00:03:18,975
可是她打垒球
but she's on the softball team.

94
00:03:18,995 --> 00:03:20,746
没关系 不可能有完美伴侣的嘛
Well, nobody's perfect.

95
00:03:20,766 --> 00:03:21,326
这样吧
Hey, you know what?

96
00:03:21,326 --> 00:03:23,246
我们出去练几球如何
Why don't we go outside and toss the ball around?

97
00:03:23,286 --> 00:03:24,906
好的
Okay.

98
00:03:24,956 --> 00:03:26,856
而且 你也不需要太杞人忧天
And you know what? I wouldn't worry too much.

99
00:03:26,876 --> 00:03:29,156
就算运动不是你强项 她还是会喜欢你的
She's gonna like you even if sports aren't your thing.

100
00:03:29,176 --> 00:03:30,256
何止不是强项啊
Aren't my thing?

101
00:03:30,296 --> 00:03:31,726
我在楼上有一副网球拍
I have a tennis racket upstairs

102
00:03:31,756 --> 00:03:33,407
我只用来给泡泡浴增加泡泡
I only use as a bubble-bath frother.

103
00:03:36,767 --> 00:03:38,367
这手套怎么戴啊
How do you put this on?

104
00:03:39,837 --> 00:03:41,507
-小姐 借过 -抱歉
- Excuse me, Miss. - Sorry.

105
00:03:41,537 --> 00:03:43,777
叫你小姐也应声
You answered to "Miss"!

106
00:03:43,807 --> 00:03:45,327
真好笑啊
Aha! Hilarious.

107
00:03:45,918 --> 00:03:48,108
格伦·惠普尔 我大学时期的宿敌
Glen Whipple, my college rival --

108
00:03:48,108 --> 00:03:49,628
拉拉队的领导
Captain of Cheer Squad.

109
00:03:49,628 --> 00:03:51,558
机器人大战界的独孤求败
Won every robot battle.

110
00:03:51,558 --> 00:03:52,918
和他在一起时的每分每秒
Every second I spent with the guy

111
00:03:52,918 --> 00:03:54,828
都让我感觉自己好渺小
just made me feel worse about myself.

112
00:03:54,898 --> 00:03:56,198
我唯一可以与他一较高下
The only thing I could compete with him in

113
00:03:56,198 --> 00:03:58,429
就是近景魔术
was close-up magic.

114
00:04:01,939 --> 00:04:03,609
很高兴见到你啊
Well, it's great to see you.

115
00:04:03,609 --> 00:04:04,789
我也是
Great to see you, too.

116
00:04:04,789 --> 00:04:06,419
我想这是你的吧
And I believe this is yours.

117
00:04:06,419 --> 00:04:07,689
怎么可能 什么时候拿的
What? When?

118
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:09,909
你要去卡片店买卡片吗
Hey, you headed over to the card shop?

119
00:04:09,909 --> 00:04:10,880
我刚刚才去完呢
I was in there earlier.

120
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,800
买了一张音乐贺卡
I got myself one of those musical cards.

121
00:04:12,850 --> 00:04:14,710
虽然有点贵 不过哥还是花的起啦
Oh. They're a little more expensive, but I can swing it.

122
00:04:14,780 --> 00:04:17,180
很好啊 见到你真好
Oh. Well, great to see you. Yeah.

123
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:19,250
顺便说下 别忘了收好你头后
By the way, don't leave without this quarter

124
00:04:19,270 --> 00:04:21,560
这两角五分钱 加点油啊 菲尔
from behind your -- come on, Phil!

125
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,661
祝你好运 邓菲
Good luck, Dunphy.

126
00:04:23,691 --> 00:04:25,191
我要去买些新的全功能运动鞋
I'm off to get some new cross-trainers.

127
00:04:25,211 --> 00:04:26,141
我的鞋磨损都挺快的
I blow through them pretty fast

128
00:04:26,141 --> 00:04:27,571
因为我很喜欢大步竞走
with all this power-walking I'm into.

129
00:04:28,021 --> 00:04:29,271
回头见
Catch you later.

130
00:04:33,781 --> 00:04:35,531
菲尔
Phil?

131
00:04:36,342 --> 00:04:37,572
你们俩在这做什么
What are you two doing here?

132
00:04:37,572 --> 00:04:38,672
为今晚准备点东西
Shopping for tonight.

133
00:04:38,712 --> 00:04:40,312
好吧 我陪你一起
Oh, well, I'll walk with you.

134
00:04:40,342 --> 00:04:42,342
-你刚去哪里了 -卡片店
- Where were you heading? - The card store.

135
00:04:42,382 --> 00:04:44,152
好可爱的孩子啊
What a beautiful child!

136
00:04:44,182 --> 00:04:46,182
你们夫妻真幸福
You and your wife must be so happy.

137
00:04:48,373 --> 00:04:50,423
我没有多想什么
I didn't think anything of it...

138
00:04:50,453 --> 00:04:52,623
直到别人也都开始犯同样的错误
until other people started making the same mistake.

139
00:04:52,663 --> 00:04:54,693
让我想起了大学做泊车小弟的那会
It reminded me of a college job I had parking cars.

140
00:04:54,713 --> 00:04:56,933
有一天 我去泊一辆阿斯顿·马丁时
One day, I had to park an Aston Martin.

141
00:04:56,963 --> 00:04:58,933
我永远也忘不了我开着那台好车时
I'll never forget the looks I got

142
00:04:58,963 --> 00:05:00,964
别人投过来的羡慕眼光
driving that baby down the block.

143
00:05:01,014 --> 00:05:02,804
这一次 我也一样要顺水推舟
I wasn't gonna dent this one.

144
00:05:02,824 --> 00:05:05,304
我们顺便去那个鞋店看看
Hey, uh, w-what would you think

145
00:05:05,344 --> 00:05:07,744
怎么样啊
about swinging by the shoe store?

146
00:05:07,754 --> 00:05:09,044
好啊 去吧
Okay, let's go.

147
00:05:13,405 --> 00:05:14,865
我还是不能相信刚才开过来的一路上
I still can't believe all the looks we got

148
00:05:14,865 --> 00:05:15,875
那些人的眼神
driving over here.

149
00:05:15,875 --> 00:05:17,595
可是你还是一直不摘掉这帽子啊
And yet you wore the hat the whole time.

150
00:05:17,625 --> 00:05:18,495
你觉得我们是不是应该
Don't you think we should

151
00:05:18,495 --> 00:05:19,785
把车停到靠近下个街区去啊
park on the next block over?

152
00:05:19,785 --> 00:05:21,065
这附近的位子都需要停车许可证
'cause this is all permit parking.

153
00:05:21,115 --> 00:05:22,615
我们以前住在这里 没事的
No, We used to live here. It's fine.

154
00:05:22,645 --> 00:05:23,945
我知道 但是还是
Yeah, still. I...

155
00:05:25,555 --> 00:05:26,816
好像没人在家
I don't think anybody's home.

156
00:05:26,856 --> 00:05:28,986
拿着 拿好了
Here. Hang on to this.

157
00:05:28,986 --> 00:05:30,856
等等 你要做什么
What -- wait, where are you going?

158
00:05:30,876 --> 00:05:33,566
去后院 我们速度拍完这照片
The backyard. We'll take this picture really quickly,

159
00:05:33,566 --> 00:05:35,066
然后立马闪人
and then we'll just get out of here.

160
00:05:35,116 --> 00:05:36,646
不要吧 就等他们回家嘛
No, let's just -- let's just wait for them to come home.

161
00:05:36,646 --> 00:05:39,117
行了 你 你这是擅闯民宅啊
Okay, that -- that's trespassing!

162
00:05:39,117 --> 00:05:41,047
不 不是的 我们以前住在这里
No, it's not. We used to live here.

163
00:05:41,067 --> 00:05:43,067
那也不代表我们有自便的权利啊
I don't think that does what you think it does.

164
00:05:43,117 --> 00:05:44,347
就知道你没胆
Of course you would baby out,

165
00:05:44,387 --> 00:05:46,557
就跟你当年不敢跳进别人家游泳池玩水一样
because this is just like pool-hopping all over again.

166
00:05:46,587 --> 00:05:48,427
我 我真不觉得那有什么好玩的嘛
I just -- I don't see what was fun about that.

167
00:05:48,457 --> 00:05:50,187
别家池中把水戏 自家池中无刺激
It made going in grandma's pool less special.

168
00:05:50,207 --> 00:05:52,008
你的生活中还真是处处充满"刺基"啊
Why don't you try being a little less special?

169
00:05:54,128 --> 00:05:56,448
会不会很高啊
Is it far?

170
00:06:03,008 --> 00:06:04,019
你好
Hello.

171
00:06:04,059 --> 00:06:06,039
你好 我是狗狗美容院的珊朵拉
Hi, it's Sandra from the dog groomer.

172
00:06:06,079 --> 00:06:06,879
我想找歌洛莉亚
I'm trying to reach Gloria.

173
00:06:06,879 --> 00:06:07,939
斯黛拉已经美容好了
Stella's ready.

174
00:06:07,979 --> 00:06:09,749
我拿了她电话
Oh, I must have her phone.

175
00:06:09,749 --> 00:06:11,269
她大概又拿错我的电话了
She probably grabbed mine again.

176
00:06:11,269 --> 00:06:13,289
听着 我是她丈夫
Listen, this is her husband.

177
00:06:13,289 --> 00:06:15,059
你那儿估计也有我的电话
You have my number right there, probably.

178
00:06:15,059 --> 00:06:17,650
-打那个电话 -好的 谢谢
- Give that a call. - Okay, thanks.

179
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,530
你好 还是我 我马上过去
Yeah, it's me again. I'll be right there.

180
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:29,991
我的确是无故把责任归咎给她了
Yeah I did blame her for no reason.

181
00:06:29,991 --> 00:06:31,651
你意见很多 说话很冲嘛 你知道吗
You have a little bit of an attitude. You know that?

182
00:06:31,651 --> 00:06:34,001
我年轻的时候 是谁做洗狗这种工作呢
You know who did your job in my day?

183
00:06:34,571 --> 00:06:35,771
水管
A hose.

184
00:06:35,801 --> 00:06:37,231
好了 左边一点 你的左边
Okay, a little to your left, a little to your left.

185
00:06:37,261 --> 00:06:38,681
对的 行了 就那儿 行了行了
Yes, okay. Right there. That's it. That's it.

186
00:06:38,721 --> 00:06:40,161
很好
Perfect. Okay.

187
00:06:40,161 --> 00:06:41,662
我得快点
And now I must run.

188
00:06:41,702 --> 00:06:43,212
来 好了 快点
Here, okay. Fast.

189
00:06:43,252 --> 00:06:44,732
准备就绪
Here we go.

190
00:06:44,762 --> 00:06:46,222
重回故居感觉有点奇怪 你不觉得吗
It's weird being back here, isn't it?

191
00:06:46,252 --> 00:06:47,922
是啊 所有的东西都没变
I know. Everything looks exactly the same.

192
00:06:47,952 --> 00:06:49,202
是啊 就除了多了栅栏
Well, you know, except for the fence.

193
00:06:49,202 --> 00:06:50,222
是啊 要那做什么啊
Yeah, what's with that?

194
00:06:50,252 --> 00:06:52,732
-他们是要关什么人吗 -就是啊
- Who are they trying to keep out, anyway? - I know.

195
00:06:53,222 --> 00:06:54,363
天呐 天呐
Oh. Oh, God. Oh, God.

196
00:06:54,393 --> 00:06:56,863
-天呐 -哇 天呐
- Oh, God. - Oh, wow. Oh, my God.

197
00:06:56,863 --> 00:06:58,213
没事 也许它很友善
No, it's okay. He might be friendly.

198
00:06:58,213 --> 00:06:59,263
-它看上去很友善啊 -很友善
- He looks nice. - He looks nice.

199
00:06:59,283 --> 00:07:00,313
你好啊
Hi.

200
00:07:00,363 --> 00:07:01,983
天呐 不要啊 他...他好快
No! Oh, god! He's -- quickly, quickly.

201
00:07:02,033 --> 00:07:03,763
不乖 一点也不乖
Not nice. So not nice.

202
00:07:03,763 --> 00:07:05,423
快快快
Hurry! Hurry, hurry, hurry!

203
00:07:05,463 --> 00:07:06,394
天呐 天呐
Oh! Oh! Oh, go oh, god!

204
00:07:07,794 --> 00:07:08,554
现在怎么办
Now what do we do?

205
00:07:08,554 --> 00:07:11,734
可以试试和它讲情 说我们以前住在这里
Well, you could try telling him we used to live here.

206
00:07:16,054 --> 00:07:16,944
估计一时半会他们不会回家
They are not coming home.

207
00:07:16,944 --> 00:07:18,174
我们得打电话求救啊
We need to call someone.

208
00:07:18,174 --> 00:07:19,015
用你的电话吧
Use your phone.

209
00:07:19,015 --> 00:07:20,695
我的电话在下面被舔的要得狂犬病了
Mine's down there getting rabies on it.

210
00:07:20,725 --> 00:07:22,125
我把电话留你车子里了
No, I left mine in your car.

211
00:07:22,145 --> 00:07:24,165
-什么 -我不想破坏裤子线条嘛
- What? - I didn't want to ruin the line of my pants.

212
00:07:24,165 --> 00:07:25,515
天啊
Oh, God.

213
00:07:25,565 --> 00:07:27,695
快看 有人来了
Oh, look. Somebody's coming.

214
00:07:27,735 --> 00:07:29,695
不 看吧
No. Okay, that is what happens

215
00:07:29,735 --> 00:07:31,035
让你没停车证还停那位子
when you park without a permit.

216
00:07:31,065 --> 00:07:32,586
停 那是我们的车
Stop! That's ours!

217
00:07:32,626 --> 00:07:35,386
我们在这上面呢 快停下
We're up here! Stop!

218
00:07:35,426 --> 00:07:37,196
他无视我
He ignored me.

219
00:07:37,226 --> 00:07:39,546
水手在树上基情尖叫 他怎么可以不停下
He didn't stop for the screaming sailor in a tree?

220
00:07:41,056 --> 00:07:42,106
鞋子借我一用
Give me your shoe.

221
00:07:42,146 --> 00:07:43,266
怎么 你以为下面那只灰太狼
What, you think that wolf down there

222
00:07:43,266 --> 00:07:44,537
还会怕鞋袭吗
is gonna be afraid of a shoe?

223
00:07:44,537 --> 00:07:47,257
不 没打算
No. No, I don't.

224
00:07:48,247 --> 00:07:49,977
你拿老爸的酒干什么
Wh-- what are you doing with dad's wine?

225
00:07:49,977 --> 00:07:51,337
小酌一杯 潇洒一回
Getting comfortable.

226
00:07:51,337 --> 00:07:55,327
咱们可能要在这里长期作战呢
We could be here for a really long time.

227
00:07:55,497 --> 00:07:58,518
好家伙 你怎么学会这样开瓶的
Whoa! Where'd you learn how to do that?

228
00:07:58,568 --> 00:08:01,168
你又是从哪弄到的现成水手服呢
Where'd you get a sailor suit on short notice?

229
00:08:01,208 --> 00:08:03,388
-算你狠 -还用说
- Fair enough. - Mm-hmm.

230
00:08:03,418 --> 00:08:05,508
好恶心 是梅乐酒
Ew. It's Merlot.

231
00:08:08,278 --> 00:08:09,779
你好
Hello.

232
00:08:09,849 --> 00:08:10,779
曼尼
Manny!

233
00:08:10,819 --> 00:08:12,049
塔拉这边怎样了
Hey, how'd it go with Tara?

234
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:13,249
还在进行中
It's still going on.

235
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:15,219
抛接球还算顺利... 基本上啦
The catch part went fine... mostly.

236
00:08:15,239 --> 00:08:17,239
我一个飞扑 摔了一身泥
I took a running dive into the dirt.

237
00:08:17,289 --> 00:08:19,089
那你有接到球吧
Oh, well, did you at least catch the ball?

238
00:08:19,159 --> 00:08:20,669
我是扔球的时候摔倒的
I was trying to throw the ball!

239
00:08:20,729 --> 00:08:22,590
我在她家浴室里找创可贴呢
I'm in her bathroom looking for band-aids.

240
00:08:22,610 --> 00:08:25,000
我想鼓起勇气向她表白 正酝酿情绪呢
I'm trying to get up the nerve to tell her how I feel.

241
00:08:25,030 --> 00:08:26,450
实话实说就好
Well, just be honest.

242
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:27,870
面对她 我压力很大啊
She intimidates me.

243
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:30,170
对她每开一次口 就犯一次二
Every time I open my mouth, I say something stupid.

244
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,900
我还夸她的卧室很"口爱"呢
I called her bedroom "fantazing."

245
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:33,090
这压根就不算个词
That's not even a word!

246
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,871
你在里面还好吗 曼尼
Are you okay in there, Manny?

247
00:08:34,911 --> 00:08:37,631
没事 我放水洗手呢
Yeah! I'm just water-washing my hands!

248
00:08:38,921 --> 00:08:40,811
救命啊 告诉我怎么说吧
Help me! Tell me what to say.

249
00:08:40,831 --> 00:08:42,781
你听这样行不行
Okay, how about this...

250
00:08:42,811 --> 00:08:46,782
你是六年级里 最美丽 最聪明
You are the prettiest, smartest, funniest girl

251
00:08:46,782 --> 00:08:48,142
最风趣的女生
in the sixth grade.

252
00:08:48,162 --> 00:08:49,852
我知道你只有十一岁
I know you're only 11,

253
00:08:49,882 --> 00:08:52,682
但我无法抑制对你的想念
but I can't stop thinking about you.

254
00:08:52,722 --> 00:08:54,622
我喜欢和你网聊的日子
I've loved talking to you online.

255
00:08:54,652 --> 00:08:57,302
我觉得 我们应该做男女朋友
I think we should become boyfriend and girlfriend.

256
00:08:57,342 --> 00:08:58,742
不不 你们想多了
No, it's not what you think.

257
00:08:58,742 --> 00:09:00,273
我在跟一小男孩说话呢
I'm talking to a little boy.

258
00:09:01,833 --> 00:09:02,743
越描越黑
Oh.

259
00:09:08,853 --> 00:09:10,483
喂
Hello.

260
00:09:10,523 --> 00:09:13,594
她没跟我在一起 小卡 我拿了她电话
She's not with me, Cam. I got her phone.

261
00:09:13,624 --> 00:09:15,144
你哭什么呢
Why are you crying?

262
00:09:15,174 --> 00:09:17,544
怎么会被从面包店里轰出来了
How do you get kicked out of a bakery?

263
00:09:17,574 --> 00:09:18,834
这就不奇怪了
Well, that'll do it.

264
00:09:18,864 --> 00:09:21,144
很抱歉要你自己来买生日蛋糕
I sorry to ask you to get your own birthday cake,

265
00:09:21,164 --> 00:09:24,485
但我实在联系不到别人了
but I can't get ahold of any-- anyone else.

266
00:09:24,525 --> 00:09:26,725
爱莫能助 我正要去湖边呢
Can't do it. I'm on my way to the lake...

267
00:09:26,755 --> 00:09:27,985
终于
Finally.

268
00:09:28,025 --> 00:09:30,105
随便在杂货店买一个吧
Just get something at the grocery store.

269
00:09:30,105 --> 00:09:32,365
我不能让你吃杂货店的蛋糕
I am not getting you a grocery-store cake.

270
00:09:32,365 --> 00:09:34,025
歌洛莉亚让我全权负责
Gloria asked me to handle this.

271
00:09:34,065 --> 00:09:35,615
出岔子的话 我会被她念死的
She's gonna yell at me, Jay.

272
00:09:35,615 --> 00:09:37,916
她说西班牙语时可毒了
she can be mean in Spanish!

273
00:09:37,986 --> 00:09:40,156
行 就这样吧 大小姐
Okay, fine. Let's wrap this up, princess.

274
00:09:40,186 --> 00:09:41,486
爱死你了 再见
Okay. Love you. Bye.

275
00:09:42,736 --> 00:09:43,956
你们在干什么
What are you guys doing?

276
00:09:43,986 --> 00:09:45,956
在剪辑给外公的生日礼物
Just editing our birthday tribute to grandpa.

277
00:09:46,026 --> 00:09:47,496
但是吧 有些采访片段
You know, some of the interviews I did

278
00:09:47,526 --> 00:09:48,596
效果不尽如人意
didn't turn out so well.

279
00:09:48,626 --> 00:09:50,367
没事的 咱们只取其精华
That's okay. We'll just use the best stuff

280
00:09:50,397 --> 00:09:51,567
充分利用手头资料
from what we all got.

281
00:09:51,587 --> 00:09:53,037
好的 海莉 有什么对外公说的
Okay, Haley, talk about grandpa.

282
00:09:53,067 --> 00:09:54,367
太恶了吧
Eww.

283
00:09:54,387 --> 00:09:56,667
我现在穿这样 聊外公也太怪了吧
I can't talk about grandpa dressed like this.

284
00:09:59,407 --> 00:10:02,678
永远爱我...
I love my --

285
00:10:02,708 --> 00:10:05,228
隔壁那狗讨厌死了
That stupid dog next door!

286
00:10:05,268 --> 00:10:07,718
杰 杰
Jay! Jay!

287
00:10:08,508 --> 00:10:09,728
杰
Jay!!

288
00:10:09,728 --> 00:10:11,258
三 四 五
...Three, four, five.

289
00:10:11,258 --> 00:10:13,098
-米奇舅舅 你觉得 -一 二
Hey, uncle Mitch, what do you think -- - One, two --

290
00:10:13,098 --> 00:10:15,039
-你干什么呢 -没干什么
- What are you doing? - N-nothing.

291
00:10:15,079 --> 00:10:18,529
非礼勿视 非礼勿言
You didn't see this, and w-we don't tell Cam.

292
00:10:18,529 --> 00:10:19,489
明白吗
Capisce?

293
00:10:19,529 --> 00:10:20,709
就一分钟的事
It'lonly take one minute.

294
00:10:20,749 --> 00:10:21,709
我一分钟也耽搁不起
We don't have a minute.

295
00:10:21,749 --> 00:10:22,829
克莱夫·比克斯比谁呀
Who's Clive Bixby?

296
00:10:22,859 --> 00:10:24,129
你妈妈的一个朋友
A friend of your mom's.

297
00:10:24,169 --> 00:10:25,499
给我改天再坏
Not now!

298
00:10:25,529 --> 00:10:27,100
小卡叔叔 你能不能说几句
Hey, uncle Cam, can you to talk about --

299
00:10:27,130 --> 00:10:28,400
对杰说几句是吧 没时间
Jay. I know. No time.

300
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,170
我还要去挽救小姑娘的生日派对呢
I got a little girl's birthday party to save.

301
00:10:30,170 --> 00:10:31,290
出去出去
Let's get out. Go.

302
00:10:31,290 --> 00:10:32,470
现在不行 宝贝
Oh, not now, honey.

303
00:10:32,510 --> 00:10:34,760
你爸刚回来 去问他吧
Your father's out back. Why don't you call him?

304
00:10:34,790 --> 00:10:35,840
菲尔
Phil!

305
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:38,480
当爹的 孩子需要你啊
Dad! Your kids need you!

306
00:10:38,510 --> 00:10:40,361
外公真的很酷
Grandpa is really cool.

307
00:10:40,361 --> 00:10:42,171
他还曾让我喝他的啤酒
He once let me drink some of his beer.

308
00:10:42,171 --> 00:10:43,131
我
for the love of --

309
00:10:43,171 --> 00:10:44,181
沙士啤酒[不含酒精]
Root beer!

310
00:10:45,241 --> 00:10:47,491
我发誓我们不只这些视频吧
I could've sworn we had more!

311
00:10:47,491 --> 00:10:49,291
让我施展我的魔法吧
Well, let me work my magic.

312
00:10:49,291 --> 00:10:50,931
只要来点创意的编辑就好
It's all about creative editing.

313
00:10:50,931 --> 00:10:52,892
只要给我两个小时
Just give me two hours

314
00:10:52,892 --> 00:10:53,712
然后再加一小时
and another hour.

315
00:10:53,762 --> 00:10:56,302
谁给我去拿杯巧克力牛奶
Somebody get me some chocolate milk

316
00:10:56,302 --> 00:10:58,002
盐多放点
with extra salt.

317
00:10:58,762 --> 00:11:01,522
还记得当初你退出童子军时
Do you remember the time you quit cub scouts

318
00:11:01,522 --> 00:11:03,432
老爸对你发火 然后你就跑到这上面来么
and dad got mad at you so you ran away up here?

319
00:11:03,452 --> 00:11:05,803
记得 你把晚餐送到这来给我吃
Right. And you brought me my dinner up here...

320
00:11:05,843 --> 00:11:07,203
-还有我的漫画书 -没错
- ...and my comic books. - Yep.

321
00:11:07,243 --> 00:11:08,923
当年要不是你还跑回家里上厕所
I think mom and dad would have been a lot more scared

322
00:11:08,963 --> 00:11:10,813
老爸老妈可能真的会吓坏
if you hadn't been running into the house to use the bathroom.

323
00:11:10,843 --> 00:11:13,493
我不能在外面尿尿
I can't go outside.

324
00:11:13,533 --> 00:11:15,453
拜你所赐 现在我想尿尿了
Great, now I'm thinking about it.

325
00:11:15,463 --> 00:11:16,483
米奇尔
Mitchell...

326
00:11:16,513 --> 00:11:17,634
这太讽刺了
it's ironic.

327
00:11:17,684 --> 00:11:20,074
我们一直想要在这院子里养条狗
We always wanted a dog in this backyard,

328
00:11:20,074 --> 00:11:21,744
但我们从未养过一条
and we could never have one.

329
00:11:21,794 --> 00:11:23,094
曼尼却养了一条
Y-- Manny got one.

330
00:11:23,124 --> 00:11:25,434
曼尼要什么有什么
Mm. Manny gets everything.

331
00:11:25,434 --> 00:11:26,164
没错
Yeah.

332
00:11:26,194 --> 00:11:28,864
你认为曼尼会得到三分之一的...
Hey, you think Manny's gonna get a third of...

333
00:11:29,915 --> 00:11:31,515
三分之一的什么
A third of what?

334
00:11:31,555 --> 00:11:32,815
你懂的
You know.

335
00:11:34,285 --> 00:11:36,065
我猜会吧
Uh...I guess.

336
00:11:36,065 --> 00:11:38,215
当然 他得到也不为过啊[杰的遗产]
Sure. I mean, that seems fair.

337
00:11:38,265 --> 00:11:39,135
对吧 是吗
Right? Does it?

338
00:11:39,135 --> 00:11:39,885
-克莱尔 是吗 因为我刚觉得 -够了
- Claire, does it? 'cause I just feel like -- - Okay?

339
00:11:39,885 --> 00:11:42,056
我想我们喝高了
You know what? I think we've probably had enough of this.

340
00:11:44,086 --> 00:11:45,626
好的 等等
Okay, wait.

341
00:11:45,656 --> 00:11:48,226
如果我们让这条狗去追赶这个娃娃
Do you think if we could get the dog to chase this doll,

342
00:11:48,266 --> 00:11:51,026
我们就能迅速跑下去捡起手机了吧
then we could run down and grab the phone really quick?

343
00:11:51,066 --> 00:11:52,336
-好办法 -是的
- We could do that! - Yeah.

344
00:11:52,366 --> 00:11:54,887
我们只要扔的远远的就好
We just are gonna have to throw it really, really far.

345
00:11:57,137 --> 00:11:58,867
没错 所以
Right. So...

346
00:11:58,887 --> 00:12:00,977
朝那边扔
That way. Mm-hmm.

347
00:12:01,007 --> 00:12:03,607
歌洛莉亚 我还想去那家的鞋店逛逛
Gloria, um, I'd still love to swing by that shoe store.

348
00:12:03,647 --> 00:12:07,418
如果你急着去的话 你就自己去吧
If you're in a hurry, go by yourself.

349
00:12:07,448 --> 00:12:09,048
不 我等你一起 惠普尔
No. I'll wait. Whipple!

350
00:12:09,088 --> 00:12:11,648
惠普尔
Whipple!

351
00:12:11,688 --> 00:12:13,998
好了
Okay! Mm!

352
00:12:13,998 --> 00:12:15,698
你觉得怎么样
What do you think?

353
00:12:15,698 --> 00:12:18,248
完美极了 转过来看看另一边
Oh, it's perfect. Uh, l-let's see the other side.

354
00:12:18,248 --> 00:12:19,269
惠普尔
Whipple!

355
00:12:19,269 --> 00:12:20,199
-咳嗽了 还好吧 -没事
- Bless you. - Thank you.

356
00:12:20,199 --> 00:12:21,919
有点太紧了 不是吗
It's a little too tight, no?

357
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:24,339
-你觉得臀部好看么 -我觉得棒极了
